 "guidance": {
  "status": "ok",
  "transcriptsRead": 4,
  "statements": [
   {
    "id": "call-2026-07-1",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-07",
    "callLabel": "Jul 2026 call · Q1 FY27",
    "callMonth": "2026-07",
    "page": 4,
    "speaker": "Praveer Sinha",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "Let's look at the transmission business, how it has performed again in last 4 years, each quarter, it has done -- again, you will see that the transmission business has shown a revenue increase of 45% CAGR, 19% in EBITDA, and 27% in PAT.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-05-1",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-05",
    "callLabel": "May 2026 call · Q4 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-05",
    "page": 5,
    "speaker": "Sumit Kishore",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "This is meaningfully below the guidance that you had given to us in November in Odisha, which was INR250 billion.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-05-2",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-05",
    "callLabel": "May 2026 call · Q4 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-05",
    "page": 6,
    "speaker": "Praveer Sinha",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "Yes, Sumit, so I agree that our guidance was, I don't think INR25,000 crores, but it was, I think, about INR22,000 crores.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-05-3",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-05",
    "callLabel": "May 2026 call · Q4 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-05",
    "page": 12,
    "speaker": "Atul Tiwari",
    "voice": "analyst",
    "quote": "Sir, I missed the FY '27 capex guidance.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-05-4",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-05",
    "callLabel": "May 2026 call · Q4 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-05",
    "page": 17,
    "speaker": "Sanjeev Churiwala",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "But then you have capex coming up in pumped storages, capex coming up in pure hydro, so a combination of all of this -- transmission as well, so I think a combination of all of this, next year is INR25,000 crores, our sense is probably going forward also, we'll have a similar kind of capital outlay.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-05-5",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-05",
    "callLabel": "May 2026 call · Q4 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-05",
    "page": 19,
    "speaker": "Apoorva Bahadur",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "In your Q4 profitability for IEL, we see an increase of almost INR63 crores.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-02-1",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-02",
    "callLabel": "Feb 2026 call · Q3 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-02",
    "page": 15,
    "speaker": "Sanjeev Churiwala",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "I think on the EPC side, we kind of target PAT margin of close to 5% to 6% every quarter.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2025-12-1",
    "sourceId": "call-2025-12",
    "callLabel": "Dec 2025 call · Q2 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2025-12",
    "page": 4,
    "speaker": "Dr․ Praveer Sinha",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "Similarly, our half yearly PAT for the Odisha Discom is Rs.279 crores and we do expect that this will be the template going forward because most of the initial issues have been sorted out.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2025-12-2",
    "sourceId": "call-2025-12",
    "callLabel": "Dec 2025 call · Q2 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2025-12",
    "page": 4,
    "speaker": "Dr․ Praveer Sinha",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "We also saw for the first time the rooftop sales crossing Rs.1,000 crores in a quarter and I think going forward you will see many of these type of new benchmarks that will be set in the rooftop business.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   }
